1
00:00:00,508 --> 00:00:03,758
(Sheldon:)Mom, you remember Rajesh?
Rajesh, my mother.

2
00:00:03,928 --> 00:00:06,928
(Raj:)Of course. Mrs. Cooper.
So nice to see you again.

3
00:00:07,098 --> 00:00:09,598
Well, it's so nice to see you too. Heh.

4
00:00:11,978 --> 00:00:16,398
(Mrs Cooper:)I thought it was our Indians
that had the occasional alcohol problem.

5
00:00:18,985 --> 00:00:20,865
(Leonard:)We don't say that, either.

6
00:00:22,781 --> 00:00:24,111
(Leonard:)I'll make you a list.

7
00:00:24,282 --> 00:00:26,872
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, that would be
mighty white of you.

8
00:00:29,704 --> 00:00:33,414
(Mrs Cooper:)So, Raj, what pain
are you trying to cover up...

9
00:00:33,583 --> 00:00:35,123
(Mrs Cooper:)...with alcohol?

10
00:00:35,293 --> 00:00:36,793
- Nothing, I'm fine.
- Are you?

11
00:00:36,961 --> 00:00:38,961
(Mrs Cooper:)No.

12
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,470
(Mrs Cooper:)That's better.
Now, tell me what's bothering you.

13
00:00:41,633 --> 00:00:43,883
I'm so Ionely.

14
00:00:44,052 --> 00:00:47,302
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes, born alone, die alone.
It's a tragic human condition.

15
00:00:47,514 --> 00:00:50,644
(Sheldon:)Now, Raj,
if you'll excuse my mother...

16
00:00:50,809 --> 00:00:53,599
(Sheldon:)...she's about to make a pecan pie
that'll be so good...

17
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:56,980
(Sheldon:)...I'll almost forget how she blew it
with the fried chicken.

18
00:00:57,148 --> 00:00:59,238
Sheldon, your friend is hurting.

